    "breadcrumb": "Dukungan Swing Catalyst \u003e Perangkat Lunak \u0026 Fitur",
    "content": "Cara membagikan video yang direkam dari aplikasi ke cloud dan cara lainnya. Mari kita mulai dengan menavigasi ke tombol “Penjelajah” yang terletak di bagian bawah aplikasi. Di sini Anda harus melihat semua video yang direkam di perangkat ini serta video yang telah diunduh. Select the swing you would like to share and press the “upload” button. After it’s done uploading press the “share” button. Here you will have a few choices on how to share the video including sending to another registered Swing Catalyst online user. Simply search for the desired recipient by first and or last name and as long as they have registered for a free online account you should find them in the list. If not check with the recipient to see if they have signed up or maybe used another name. Lastly you will have a choice to add any comments before sending. The recipient should receive an email and notification on on their app once it’s delivered. Last updated: 2021-06-16 | View on official support site",
