    "breadcrumb": "Dukungan Swing Catalyst \u003e Perangkat Lunak \u0026 Fitur",
    "content": "Artikel ini menjelaskan cara menggunakan aplikasi Swing Catalyst Remote Support untuk memungkinkan tim dukungan teknis Swing Catalyst masuk sementara ke komputer Anda dan mengendalikan mouse serta keyboard Anda. Diasumsikan bahwa Anda telah diperintahkan untuk datang ke sini oleh seseorang dari staf dukungan Swing Catalyst.\nDukungan jarak jauh sangat membantu untuk berbagai hal:\nMemperbaiki masalah yang sebaliknya sulit dijelaskan melalui email dan telepon\nMempercepat prosesnya - mengirim email bolak-balik membutuhkan banyak waktu\nDapatkan bantuan segera jika kebutuhan mendesak\nCatatan Swing Catalyst Remote Support hanya tersedia untuk pelanggan dengan paket Support \u0026 Update yang valid. Dukungan dasar hanya mencakup komunikasi email.\nKami tidak akan memiliki akses ke komputer Anda tanpa izin Anda dan Anda dapat menonton apa yang sedang dilakukan kapan saja. Aplikasi ini hanya dimaksudkan untuk membantu pelanggan dan akan digunakan dengan bertanggung jawab.\nLangkah 1 - Buka Swing Catalyst Dari menu utama, pilih Help dan klik “Start Remote Support”.\nA window will pop open with an ID number. Make sure to send that to your support representative when instructed to do so.\nAlternative way to start remote support Click the Windows start menu, if you have Windows 8, hit the Windows logo key on your keyboard. Type in “remote support”. You should find Swing Catalyst Remote Support application. Click it to run.\nThe remote support application will show a dialog window similar to the picture below. Make note of the ID number below, 9 digits. Keep the application running to let support staff connect to your computer. Step 3 - Notify Swing Catalyst Support Staff Assuming you were instructed to follow this article by someone in the support staff, notify the support agent of the ID you just noted in the remote support application. Typically you will provide this ID through your support ticket. You do not need to give up any password, just the ID.\nIf you don’t have an open support ticket with us you can create a new one by contacting our support team. Explain what you need assistance with and include the ID to speed up the process.\nA support agent will connect to your computer and communicate with you through the remote support application. When the session is over, you are free to close the Swing Catalyst remote support application. We will not be able to connect when it is not running.\nLast updated: 2023-12-15 | View on official support site",
    "description": "Dukungan Jarak Jauh SwingCatalyst hanya tersedia untuk pelanggan dengan paket Support \u0026 Update yang valid. Dukungan dasar hanya mencakup komunikasi email.",
    "tags": [
      "Troubleshooting"
    ],
    "title": "Cara Menggunakan Dukungan Jarak Jauh",
    "uri": "/sc-support/id/software-features/remote-support/index.html"
