    "breadcrumb": "Dukungan Swing Catalyst \u003e Referensi",
    "content": "You can find Swing Catalyst User Guide article here\nLast updated: 2023-10-20 | View on official support site",
    "description": "Panduan pengguna komprehensif untuk perangkat lunak Swing Catalyst dan platform online",
    "tags": [],
    "title": "Panduan Pengguna Perangkat Lunak Swing Catalyst \u0026 Platform Online",
    "uri": "/sc-support/id/reference/user-guide-online/index.html"
